// [acc] PANZER boss (Spiki asset-dump mechz port - user 2026-07-08; previously live
// 2026-06-19, recipe tools/_panzer_stash/README.md + docs/research/BO3_Panzer_mechz_usermap_
// method.txt). Custom aitype archetype_zm_mechz_genesis: GDT = source_data/mechz_spiki.gdt +
// model/xanim/fx/sound at the Mod Tools root (gitignored, tools/external_assets_manifest.ps1
// "Panzer / mechz"). Spawned at RUNTIME via SpawnActor("archetype_zm_mechz_genesis", ...) -
// NO .map spawner entity (custom-aitype .map spawners crashed the LED bake (Avogadro, above)
// and game load (Rogue Protector, below)); like Avogadro's spawner_ line this aitype MUST be
// listed explicitly - no BSP entity pulls it in. The aitype pulls model+anims+ASM/BT transitively.
aitype,archetype_zm_mechz_genesis
