// pack's own copies are identical DLC rips and were NOT copied over HB21's. The decompile's
// maps/zombie_tomb/* names exist NOWHERE - repointed to the dlc1/castle equivalents (csc too).
// fx_mech_dmg_sparks may emit the WAIVED gfx_spark_blink_anim_pcloud_em linker noise (stash
