// (The stock perk bar is hidden by ZEROING its hudItems.perks.* uimodel fields in GSC -
// _acc_lui::clear_stock_perk_hud - NOT by asset override: a usermap zone loads LAST and a
// same-named base-zone asset always wins, so transparent image overrides do nothing.)

// Makes the linker read the weapons table (box needs this). The usermap copy
// at gamedata/weapons/zm/ (deployed by sync) overrides the stock table: it is
// the stock 50-weapon table + the 3 Skye box imports below.
stringtable,gamedata/weapons/zm/zm_levelcommon_weapons.csv

// Box guns (Skye imports; see docs/32 + docs/33). One pair per gun (base + PaP).
// (Original Ripper convertible REMOVED 2026-06-23 - couldn't be fully twinned.)
weapon,s1_tac19
weapon,s1_tac19_up

// Klauser (Vanguard s4_klauser, Skye VG port) = C-tier box pistol (user 2026-07-05). Base = semi
// (dmg 20), PaP = full-auto (dmg 400) - the transform is split by a two-line balance mult (M1911
// pattern). Single-wield. FULLY TWINNED (twin block below, auto-gen by apply_recoil_overhaul.js).
// Clean body loc mults. External pack (gitignored, tools/external_assets_manifest.ps1).

// Five-Seven (BO2 t6_fiveseven) = the STARTING pistol (level.start_weapon, set
// in _acc_main::init). Dual-wield variants included (PaP akimbo). ASM1 = AW SMG (box).
weapon,t6_fiveseven
weapon,t6_fiveseven_up
weapon,t6_fiveseven_rdw_zm
weapon,t6_fiveseven_ldw_zm
weapon,t6_fiveseven_rdw_up_zm
weapon,t6_fiveseven_ldw_up_zm
// RETIRED 2026-07-03 (user: "least liked gun, remove it for now") - uncomment to restore.
// Assets stay installed (GDT/models/sounds/twin blocks untouched); to fully restore also
// re-add the zm_levelcommon_weapons.csv row (deleted, matching the PDW/M1911 precedent):
//   s1_asm1,s1_asm1_up,,1300,smg,,,,,TRUE,FALSE,FALSE,,,FALSE,TRUE,smg,,,
// and un-comment the GSC table entries marked "ASM1 RETIRED 2026-07-03" (box pool/rarity,
// overclocks, abilities, variant_guns, pap bucket, perk_info) + the twin lines below.
// weapon,s1_asm1
// weapon,s1_asm1_up

// Blast-O-Matic (CW DOA energy blaster, Owens port v1.2; user 2026-07-03, GREEN-LIT install).
// PROJECTILE wonder-class special that IS fully twinned (user requirement) - the standard
// generator refuses projectileweapon.gdf, so its 14 twins are HAND-BUILT clones inside
// acc_weapon_variants.gdt (canonical TWIN_DIMS mults on the projectile-equivalent fields).
// GDT install-side: source_dataowens_weaponsocwwpn_t9_shotgun_semiauto_cb_cosplay.gdt;
// aliases share
// aliases: share\raw\sound\aliases\_owens_weapons.csv (szc block acc). See CREDITS (Owens).
weapon,t9_semiauto_cosplay
weapon,t9_semiauto_cosplay_up

// LEVIATHAN AXE (WetEgg God of War port, 2026-07-07): wonder-tier box melee. Asset ids bake the
// _zm suffix (zone keeps it; ALL script/CSV refs use the stripped runtime names leviathan /
// leviathan_up - the apex _zm trap, memory apex-weapons-pack-integration). GDT rides bin\
// converter_gdt_dirs_0.txt's _custom entry.
weapon,leviathan_zm
weapon,leviathan_up_zm
// Leviathan PaP-tier SPEED twins (+5% swing per tier, user 2026-07-09): _acc_spdN clones in
// acc_weapon_variants.gdt (meleeTime/fireTime x0.95 per tier), swapped by axis_lev_speed off the
// stored PaP tier. weaponfull like every other twin (not in the weapons CSV; box-excluded).
weaponfull,leviathan_acc_spd1_zm
weaponfull,leviathan_up_acc_spd2_zm
weaponfull,leviathan_up_acc_spd3_zm
// Leviathan BERZERKER twins (boss item 11, +35% swing, user 2026-07-11): one _brz form per PaP
// tier (meleeTime/fireTime / 1.35 off that tier's spd form; clones in acc_weapon_variants.gdt via
// tools/oneshots/gen_berzerker_twins.js), swapped by axis_brz stacking with axis_lev_speed.
weaponfull,leviathan_acc_brz_zm
weaponfull,leviathan_acc_spd1_brz_zm
weaponfull,leviathan_up_acc_spd2_brz_zm
weaponfull,leviathan_up_acc_spd3_brz_zm

// AK-47 (BO2 t9_ak47) = full-auto AR box gun (user, 2026-06-14). See docs/33.
weapon,t9_ak47
weapon,t9_ak47_up

// XM4 (Cold War t9_xm4) = full-auto AR box gun, S tier (user, 2026-07-04). See docs/33.
weapon,t9_xm4
weapon,t9_xm4_up

// Streetsweeper (Cold War t9_streetsweeper) = full-auto shotgun box gun, A tier (user, 2026-07-04). See docs/33.
weapon,t9_streetsweeper
weapon,t9_streetsweeper_up

// CEL-3 Cauterizer (AW s1_cel3) = triple-barrel full-auto SPREAD shotgun box gun, B tier (user, 2026-07-05).
// bulletweapon, single-wield, empty altWeapon; twin-less first pass. Loc normalized install-side. See docs/33.
weapon,s1_cel3
weapon,s1_cel3_up

// AE4 (AW s1_ae4) = directed-energy AR box gun (user, 2026-06-14). See docs/33.
weapon,s1_ae4
weapon,s1_ae4_up

// RW1 (AW s1_rw1) = directed-energy PISTOL (user 2026-06-23). FULLY TWINNED (bulletweapon,
// single-wield, regular _up) - twin weaponfull lines are auto-generated in the twin block below.
weapon,s1_rw1
weapon,s1_rw1_up
// Mahem (AW s1_mahem) = molten-metal ROCKET LAUNCHER (user 2026-06-23). EXEMPT explosive special
// (projectileweapon, NO twins, like the Thundergun WW); empty altWeapon so no _zm_zm Com_ERROR.
weapon,s1_mahem
weapon,s1_mahem_up
// War Machine (BO2 t6_war_machine) = 6-round drum GRENADE LAUNCHER (user 2026-07-09, "explodes on
// land"). EXEMPT explosive special like the Mahem (projectileweapon; empty altWeapon so no _zm_zm
// Com_ERROR; is_aat_exempt CSV col -> make_war_machine_pap_visible_to_tier3). IMPACT detonation is
// GDT-native (fuseTime 0.0 / forceBounce 0 - Skye's port already removed BO2's bouncing fuse; same
// fields as the proven China Lake). PaP "Dystopic Demolisher" = 12-round FULL-AUTO drum. Projectile
// model wm_t6_gl_grenade ships in skye_t6_wepcommon.gdt; stock rocket explosion FX. Speed-Cola-only
// fastreload twins in the twin block below (the Mahem wonder-tier pattern).
weapon,t6_war_machine
weapon,t6_war_machine_up
// Apex Legends guns (zeroy pack, user 2026-07-06 migration). Asset ids carry a baked _zm; _up forms in acc_apex_up.gdt (legend-skin PaP model). Twin-less.
weapon,apex_peacekeeper_zm
weapon,apex_peacekeeper_up_zm
weapon,apex_beam_rifle_zm
weapon,apex_beam_rifle_up_zm
weapon,apex_alternator_zm
weapon,apex_alternator_up_zm
weapon,apex_prowler_zm
weapon,apex_prowler_up_zm
weapon,t9_m16
weapon,t9_m16_up
// HAVOC wind-up is ENGINE-NATIVE only (v3, user 2026-07-06): fireDelay 1.25 + riser + shake anim in the
// base/_up defs - re-winds every trigger pull (the actual Apex Havoc). NO charge-twin defs are packed:
// both scripted persistence attempts (quarter-steps, 2s spool twin) swapped defs on a HELD weapon, which
// visibly yanks the viewmodel every burst - see _acc_havoc_charge.gsc (dead file, not compiled) + CHANGELOG.
// Apex ammo-counter UI3D meshes - REQUIRED by the pack Readme ("Weapon names + LUA for Zone Source").
// Every apex gun attaches one via attachViewModel1 (alternator/peacekeeper=glass_ammo, prowler=glass_ammo_bigger).
// (The Readme's two AmmocounterZM *.lua rawfiles are the optional WIP ammo-counter UI - intentionally NOT shipped.)
xmodel,glass_ammo
xmodel,glass_ammo_smaller
xmodel,glass_ammo_bigger
// China Lake (BO1 t5_china_lake) = pump-action GRENADE LAUNCHER (user 2026-07-05). EXEMPT explosive special
// like the Mahem (projectileweapon, NO twins); empty altWeapon so no _zm_zm Com_ERROR; is_aat_exempt CSV
// flag -> needs make_china_lake_pap_visible_to_tier3. Stock rocket explosion FX (fx_exp_rocket_default_sm).
// BO1 Thundergun (user 2026-07-02): TheAllNightFall's t5 port OVERRIDES the stock thundergun_zm /
// thundergun_upgraded_zm weapon assets IN PLACE (same names -> zero GSC/box/damage-table changes;
// night_t5_thundergun.gdt shadows the stock entries). These lines pack OUR overridden weapon files
// into the .ff (per the pack README). External pack - see tools/external_assets_manifest.ps1.
weapon,thundergun_zm
weapon,thundergun_upgraded_zm

// Box guns. AK-74u/M60/RPD are Cold War (t9) ports (user 2026-06-26): regular _up, empty altWeapon, models
// compiled. (PDW-57 / M1911 / Nail Gun / Ripper REMOVED 2026-06-23 - none could be fully twinned for the
// Mega-perk handling buffs; see CHANGELOG + docs/33.)
weapon,s4_ppsh41_base
weapon,s4_ppsh41_base_up
weapon,t9_ak74u
weapon,t9_ak74u_up

// Olympia (BO2 t6_olympia) = double-barrel shotgun box gun (user, 2026-06-15). BO1 rip
// only had GDTs installed, so the BO2 port is used (same gun). Twin-less (weapon-count cap).
weapon,t6_olympia
